                <articleBody jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="company/components/text" textIsRich="true"
                    text="&lt;h2&gt;Protein, Simplified&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For most people training regularly, 1.6-2.2g of protein per kg of bodyweight per day supports muscle and recovery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spread it across 3-4 meals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prioritise a protein source each meal&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Whole foods first, shakes to top up&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Consistency matters more than perfection.&lt;/p&gt;"/>
